{
  "id": "evaluate-reverse-polish-notation",
  "order": 44,
  "title": "Evaluate Reverse Polish Notation",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "pattern": "Stack",
  "statement": "Evaluate an arithmetic expression given in Reverse Polish Notation as an array of `tokens` (integers and `+ - * /`). Division truncates toward zero. Return the result.",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= tokens.length <= 10^4",
    "The expression is valid and never divides by zero",
    "Intermediate values fit in a 32-bit integer"
  ],
  "function": {
    "name": "evalRPN",
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "tokens",
        "type": "string[]"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "int"
  },
  "complexity": {
    "time": "O(n)",
    "space": "O(n)"
  },
  "hints": [
    "Where do an operator's operands live when you reach it?",
    "Push numbers on a stack; an operator pops two values. Mind the order for - and /.",
    "Pop b, then a, and push a op b. Make sure division truncates toward zero (C++ does; Python's // floors)."
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "2",
          "1",
          "+",
          "3",
          "*"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 9,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "(2 + 1) * 3 = 9."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "4",
          "13",
          "5",
          "/",
          "+"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 6,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "4 + 13 / 5 = 6."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "10",
          "6",
          "9",
          "3",
          "+",
          "-11",
          "*",
          "/",
          "*",
          "17",
          "+",
          "5",
          "+"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 22,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "22."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "7"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 7,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "-7",
          "2",
          "/"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": -3,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "3",
          "-4",
          "-"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 7,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "0",
          "3",
          "/"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 0,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "5"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 5,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "-8",
          "2",
          "/",
          "-6",
          "+",
          "-4",
          "-8",
          "+",
          "*"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 120,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "9",
          "-1",
          "-",
          "9",
          "*"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": 90,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "7",
          "5",
          "*",
          "-3",
          "/"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": -11,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "-4",
          "-7",
          "*",
          "-1",
          "*"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": -28,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          "-6",
          "-1",
          "/",
          "8",
          "*",
          "-5",
          "*",
          "2",
          "+"
        ]
      ],
      "expected": -238,
      "hidden": true
    }
  ]
}
